# Ubuntu packages the reference image adds to the vendor vLLM image. python-is-python3 gives
# the image `python`, the name harness roles start under; ca-certificates is the snapshot's.
# The rest is what Apptainer's .deb depends on and the vendor image lacks: the driver starts
# each trajectory's sandbox with Apptainer inside its own container. Pinned into
# apt-reference.txt by
#   hls images lock-apt ubuntu apt-reference --task agentic_coding
python-is-python3
ca-certificates
fakeroot
libfakeroot
libfuse3-3
liblzo2-2
libprotobuf-c1
libsubid4
libtalloc2
uidmap
